WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.875
Your turn.

2
00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:09.923
The Studio 3 project asks you to build this harness around your Studio 2 system and use it to make at least two improvements you can defend with intervals.

3
00:00:10.203 --> 00:00:20.144
Build in this order: the dataset and labels first, then the code graders, then one calibrated judge, then the comparison and log, then the gate, then the improvements.

4
00:00:20.424 --> 00:00:27.933
The order matters, because an improvement measured by an unchecked judge on an unversioned dataset isn’t evidence of anything.

5
00:00:28.213 --> 00:00:33.845
Finish with the stakeholder write-up, and ask someone outside engineering to read the first paragraph.
